  {
    "hotel_id": "51486",
    "hotel_url": "https://www.agoda.com/hotel-grand-terrace-chitose/hotel/sapporo-jp.html",
    "name": "Hotel Grand Terrace Chitose",
    "detail": "Staff are nice, friendly and polite, they speak english too. they also guide you how to go to lake Sikotsu . Ride bus no 4 at the bus stop just infront of Hotel. They provide the time table for the bus going to the lake. theres a free shuttle from airport if you arrive from 6PM to 11 PM, no need to book the Shuttle just hop in when it arrives. Ask the information counter at the Domestic Airport they will guide you on where to fine the Shuttle to the Hotel. If your arrival is not within above timing, just ride the JR Train bound to Sapporo or Otaru and alight to Chitose Station which is 2 stops from the Airport, from there take taxi going to Hotel and get the receipt from the driver which cost about 700 plus yen. Once check in provide the receipt to the Staff and they will reimburse the cost of the Taxi fare. Free flow of Tea, Coffee and pop corn at the lobby, free massage chair, table tennis, sauna and free rice with soup from 10pm-12am at the restaurant. Clean rooms too! thumbs Up! ",
