  {
    "hotel_id": "187085",
    "hotel_url": "https://www.agoda.com/jr-inn-sapporo/hotel/sapporo-jp.html",
    "name": "JR Inn Sapporo",
    "detail": "Very conveniently located to the JR Sapporo station (as long as it doesn't rain or snow). High quality toiletries are provided (no shower cap though). Their twin room is bigger sized than most rooms in Japan with plenty of space to move around even with two big luggage laid out. Complimentary breakfast choices are limited and the same every day, but all are of high quality. Love their fresh Hokkaido milk and their potato salad - they were my daily must-haves when I stayed there for 5 nights. Front desk staff always have a great smile and never failed to greet guests. There is only one pillow provided per bed in the room, but you are always welcome to get another pillow of your preference from the pillow selection next to the front desk. Amazing hotel - I will definitely stay again if I'm visiting Sapporo again.",
